WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:31.700
Access to a senior person can be mistaken for authority . We know the intended result. Now identify who may contribute and who must decide. People may ask an assistant to decide because the assistant works close to the executive. That can be helpful access, but it does not transfer a finance, legal or protection mandate . We will compare actual responsibilities rather than rank job titles. A personal assistant ( PA ) may have overlapping support responsibilities; the actual work and permission must be agreed rather than inferred from either title.
